-oeYIQ7kNvwFt0w_G&_nc_oc=Adr9ubARKAPPEb-FBeNerar_UiWZjG7rJB6euud2QhitWxgwQth6aU9pOzrQp3fFumo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQXcHNtr7kZTlqZzll_wdRWZ5kUZUSYNg43DdJkkumsJQ&oe=6AF9EC08"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCoverImage.png", "id": "1307953604354318", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619187_1307953607687651_415736046812000494_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QlbttbGgJ6YQ7kNvwH8zQ9S&_nc_oc=AdqBBWN_2UWJX8y0Mk6UkEBpAGJamwlkm0j_1qzy3w9k72_7hXsTgJoVvpNAZpk8hi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSD8Oh9vSVpbcV9q8sOzv0JomcURaIfWmOP7p5MigPO8A&oe=6AF9DF8E"}, "display_name": "LiveXR Workflow", "keywords": ["Training", "Senario", "Enterprise", "Corporate", "Educational"], "long_description": "About \"LiveXR Workflow\"\n\"LiveXR Workflow\" is a service specialized in procedural and process-based training. It allows users to review formal procedures (the correct path) by replicating various real-world scenarios.\n\nKey Features:\n\nSkill-Based Modes: Offers Beginner and Expert modes to provide tailored training suited to the user's skill level.\n\nImmersive Hands-On Experience: Enables users to interact with objects (grab, move, rotate, etc.) and verify checklist steps within a VR environment.\n\nPerformance Tracking: Records the duration of each step, which can be utilized to measure training effectiveness and drive operational improvements.\n\nPre-Training Preparation: By allowing users to learn the working environment and operational methods in advance, it minimizes mistakes and confusion, supporting safe and efficient training.", "short_description": "A solution specialized in procedural and process-based training"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "LiveXR_Workflow_Icon.png", "id": "1598811945581411", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619485_1598811948914